        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "城中人希望苏迈在旧荣耀与新生计之间保持分寸。把每座遗迹都变成祭坛不能养活居民，把所有石料拆去牟利也会让一个民族忘记自己。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
